h2. Supported date/time formats (DateTimeNormalizerHandler)

All date fields are parsed into an {{Instant}} (UTC) and stored in MongoDB as a {{Date}}.

h3. Accepted formats

||Format||Example(s)||
|{{yyyy-MM-dd}}|{{2026-03-06}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-ddXXX}}|{{2026-03-06Z}}, {{2026-03-06+02:00}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm}}|{{2026-03-06T14:30}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mmXXX}}|{{2026-03-06T14:30Z}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30+02:00}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss}}|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ssXXX}}|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00Z}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30:00+02:00}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30:00-05:00}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.S}} (1 to 9 decimals)|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00.1}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123456789}}|
|{{yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SXXX}} (1 to 9 decimals)|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123Z}}, {{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123+02:00}}|

*Offset ({{XXX}}) can be:* {{Z}} (UTC), {{±HH:mm}} (e.g. {{+02:00}}) or {{±HH:mm:ss}} (e.g. {{+02:00:00}}).

h3. Conversion rules

* *Date only* (no time): the time defaults to {{00:00}}.
* *No offset*: the value is interpreted in the *Europe/Paris* time zone.
* *With offset*: the value is converted to UTC using that offset.

||Input||Stored value (UTC)||
|{{2026-03-06}}|{{2026-03-05T23:00:00Z}}|
|{{2026-03-06Z}}|{{2026-03-06T00:00:00Z}}|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00}}|{{2026-03-06T13:30:00Z}}|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00+02:00}}|{{2026-03-06T12:30:00Z}}|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123Z}}|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00.123Z}}|

{note}A date without time and without offset (e.g. {{2026-03-06}}) is midnight *Paris time*, so it is stored as the previous day at 23:00 (or 22:00 in summer) in UTC.{note}

h3. Rejected formats

||Input||Reason||
|{{2026-03-06T14}}|Hour without minutes|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00+02}}|Offset without minutes|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00+0200}}|Offset without colon|
|{{2026-03-06 14:30:00}}|Space instead of {{T}}|
|{{2026-03-06t14:30:00z}}|Lowercase {{t}} / {{z}}|
|{{20260306}}, {{20260306T143000Z}}|Compact (basic) format without separators|
|{{2026-03-06T14:30:00.1234567890Z}}|More than 9 decimals|
|{{2026-02-30}}|Invalid calendar date|